<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=1280">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="only light">
<title>OpenCode Cockpit</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:,">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/web/app.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="rail"><nav data-nav aria-label="Main navigation"><div class="rail-brand">Oc<span>Cockpit</span></div><div id="nav-links"></div><p class="rail-note">One team.<br>Work worth keeping.</p></nav></div>
<div class="workspace">
<header class="top">
  <div class="brand"><p class="eyebrow">Your agent workspace</p><h1>OpenCode Cockpit</h1><p class="sub">Live run <code id="run">Connecting</code></p></div>
  <div class="meters"><span id="backend" class="pill" data-state="connecting" title="Waiting for a response from the backend.">Connecting</span><span id="launches" class="meter">0 / 0 launches</span><span id="top-links" class="actions"></span></div>
</header>
<p id="notice" class="notice" hidden></p>
<main>
<section data-view="home" aria-labelledby="home-h">
  <section data-hero class="hero"><div class="page-head"><div><p id="hero-date" class="eyebrow">Today</p><h2 id="home-h">Make room for good work.</h2><p id="hero-sentence">Give your team a clear goal, then follow the work here.</p></div><div id="home-day-link"></div></div><div id="hero-stats" class="stats"></div></section>
  <section class="card compose-card"><h3>What would you like the team to do?</h3>
    <form data-compose id="compose-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
      <label>Title <input id="compose-title" name="title" required maxlength="80" placeholder="A useful name for this order"></label>
      <label>Goal <textarea id="compose-goal" name="goal" required rows="3" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Describe the result you want and who it helps."></textarea></label>
      <div id="compose-lead"></div>
      <p data-form-error id="compose-error" class="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <div class="actions"><button data-compose-submit type="submit" id="compose-submit">Send to lead</button><span class="hint">Cmd / Ctrl + Enter to send</span></div>
    </form>
  </section>
  <section class="card attention-card"><h3>Needs attention</h3><ul data-attention id="attention"></ul></section>
  <div class="two-col"><section class="card"><h3>Today's orders</h3><div id="home-orders" class="orders"></div></section><section class="card"><h3>Next planned days</h3><div id="home-plans" class="orders"></div></section></div>
  <section class="card"><div class="block-head"><h3>Team</h3><a href="#/team">Open the team</a></div><div data-home-team id="home-team" class="team"></div></section>
  <section class="card"><div class="block-head"><h3>Recent activity</h3><a href="#/ledger">Open the ledger</a></div><ol data-activity id="activity" class="activity"></ol></section>
  <div id="history-warnings"></div>
</section>
<section data-view="calendar" hidden aria-labelledby="calendar-h">
  <div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Plan the work. Follow the results.</p><h2 id="calendar-h">Calendar</h2></div><div class="actions"><button data-cal="prev" class="quiet" aria-label="Previous month">Previous</button><button data-cal="today" class="quiet">Today</button><button data-cal="next" class="quiet" aria-label="Next month">Next</button></div></div>
  <div class="card calendar-card"><div id="weekdays" class="calendar-grid"></div><div id="calendar-grid" class="calendar-grid"></div></div>
  <div id="calendar-legend" class="legend"></div>
</section>
<section data-view="day" hidden aria-labelledby="day-h">
  <div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">One day at a time</p><h2 id="day-h">Day</h2></div><div id="day-nav" class="actions"></div></div>
  <div id="day-stats" class="stats"></div>
  <div class="two-col"><div class="stack"><section class="card"><h3>Orders</h3><div id="day-orders" class="orders"></div></section><section class="card"><h3>Planned orders</h3><div id="day-plans" class="orders"></div><p id="plan-result" role="status"></p></section></div>
  <section class="card"><h3 id="form-heading">New order</h3>
    <form data-day-form id="order-form" data-mode="closed" autocomplete="off">
      <div data-form-lead id="form-lead" data-actor=""></div>
      <p data-readonly-why id="day-readonly" class="hint">Waiting for the backend's calendar.</p>
      <label>Title <input id="f-title" name="title" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Release notes for v0.3" disabled></label>
      <label>Goal <textarea id="f-goal" name="goal" required rows="4" maxlength="4000" placeholder="What should exist when this is done, and what it is for." disabled></textarea></label>
      <div class="pair"><label>Write scope <input id="f-writes" name="writes" maxlength="120" placeholder="auto: order folder" disabled></label><label>Budget <input id="f-budget" name="budget" type="number" min="1" max="99" value="6" required disabled></label></div>
      <p class="hint">Goes to the lead. The floor judge checks file presence, non-empty content and format. It does not judge quality.</p>
      <div class="actions"><button data-day-submit id="f-send" type="submit" disabled>Issue order</button><span data-day-result id="f-result" class="result" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
    </form>
  </section></div>
</section>
<section data-view="order" hidden aria-label="Order details"><div id="order-detail"></div></section>
<section data-view="library" hidden aria-label="Library"><div id="library-content"></div></section>
<section data-view="board" hidden aria-labelledby="board-h"><div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Across all runs</p><h2 id="board-h">Board</h2></div></div><div id="board-columns" class="board"></div></section>
<section data-view="team" hidden aria-labelledby="team-h"><div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The live run</p><h2 id="team-h">Team</h2></div></div><section class="card"><p class="hint">Each seat uses its own model. The lead plans; workers hand in files.</p><div id="team" class="team"></div></section><section class="card"><h3>Launches</h3><div id="team-launches"></div></section></section>
<section data-view="files" hidden aria-labelledby="files-h"><div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The live run</p><h2 id="files-h">Files handed in</h2></div></div><section class="card"><div id="files" class="files"></div></section></section>
<section data-view="ledger" hidden aria-labelledby="ledger-h"><div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">The live run</p><h2 id="ledger-h">Ledger</h2></div></div><section class="card"><p class="hint">An append-only record. Newest rows first.</p><ol id="ledger" class="ledger" reversed></ol></section></section>
<section data-view="help" hidden aria-labelledby="help-h"><div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A short field guide</p><h2 id="help-h">From an idea to accepted files</h2></div></div>
  <section class="card"><ol class="help-steps"><li><strong>Every order goes to the lead.</strong> The lead plans, the other seats do the parts, and the judge decides.</li><li><strong>Write an order.</strong> Give it a title and a goal: what should exist and why. The lead splits it into sub-orders for the team.</li><li><strong>Open the calendar.</strong> Choose a day to see its orders. Every order opens the same page with its flow, seats, launches, files and ledger.</li><li><strong>Plan ahead.</strong> Save an order on a future day. When it becomes due, press Issue now yourself. Dates never start agents automatically. Earlier days are read-only.</li><li><strong>Read the judge's decision.</strong> The default judge checks that files were handed in, are not empty and match their claimed format. It does not assess quality. Refused work can be sent back for another attempt.</li><li><strong>Know the limits.</strong> The top bar shows this backend's launch count and limit. Each order allows two launches; each process has a wall-time limit. Budget belongs to the order and its sub-orders. There is no separate money limit. Past runs are read-only.</li></ol></section>
  <section class="card"><h3>A library that stays with your team</h3><p>Keep a handed-in file as a skill or reference from an order. The Library holds these files, finished workflows, and lessons from work sent back. Each order shows what the lead reused; the cost chart compares launches, retries, and elapsed seconds.</p><p>People can keep files and review proposals. The program records workflows and lessons. The lead may propose a skill, but it reaches no seat until a person accepts it. Reject a proposal with a reason so the team can learn from it.</p></section>
  <h3 class="examples-heading">Start with an example</h3><div id="examples" class="team"></div>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="foot">Local workspace. Agent command: <code>opencode run --format json -m &lt;model&gt;</code>.</footer>
</div>
<aside id="preview" class="preview" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="File preview" tabindex="-1" hidden><div class="preview-head"><code id="preview-path"></code><button id="preview-close" type="button" class="quiet">Close</button></div><pre id="preview-text"></pre></aside>
<div data-toast id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<script src="/web/icons.js"></script>
<script src="/web/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
OC_EOF_42
